---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of using DevKDP. The short version: results are best-effort and you accept the site as-is.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/terms/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-10-15</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Use at your own risk</h2>
    <p>DevKDP's tools provide results based on the inputs you enter, using browser-native parsing and encoding (<code>JSON.parse</code>, <code>btoa</code>, <code>atob</code>) plus standard formatting conventions. They are not a substitute for production validation, schema checking, or security review. For high-stakes uses (signed payloads, secret tokens, regulatory data) always verify against your downstream system.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">No warranty</h2>
    <p>The site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that formatting, encoding, or validation results are error-free.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, DevKDP and its operators are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on its outputs.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">External links</h2>
    <p>Pages may contain links to third-party sites. We do not endorse or vouch for the products or content of third parties.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The site's design, code, and original written content are © DevKDP / Kdp.Cool.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site means you accept the current terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/contact/" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">Contact</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
